@startuml
title Glow Live v2 架構圖 - WebRTC + SFU

actor Broadcaster as B
actor Viewer as V

participant "前端：主播頁\n(Browser)" as FE_B
participant "信令伺服器\n(WebSocket)" as Signal
participant "WebRTC SFU\n(LiveKit / mediasoup / ion)" as SFU
participant "前端：觀眾頁\n(Browser)" as FE_V

== 推流流程 ==
B -> FE_B: 開啟鏡頭 getUserMedia()
FE_B -> Signal: WebSocket connect
FE_B -> Signal: 傳送 SDP offer
Signal -> SFU: 傳送 SDP offer
SFU -> Signal: 回傳 SDP answer
Signal -> FE_B: 回傳 SDP answer
FE_B --> SFU: 建立 PeerConnection 傳送 MediaStream

== 觀眾播放流程 ==
V -> FE_V: 進入觀看頁面
FE_V -> Signal: WebSocket connect
FE_V -> Signal: 請求訂閱 room
Signal -> SFU: 傳送 SDP offer (觀眾)
SFU -> Signal: 回傳 SDP answer
Signal -> FE_V: 回傳 SDP answer
SFU --> FE_V: 傳送遠端 MediaStream
FE_V -> V: 顯示直播畫面 <video>

@enduml